TEXT 16 -32 Left 2 ;INPUT: 24 V bench supply, C4 bulk, C5/C6 hot-loop ceramics
TEXT 384 -32 Left 2 ;POWER STAGE: T1 primary (Wurth 750311591), Q1 IRF520N, R4 current sense
TEXT 456 300 Left 1 ;Q1 on the board
TEXT 16 320 Left 2 ;GATE DRIVE (open loop): fixed duty D at fs, 12 V
TEXT 496 368 Left 2 ;SNUB RC snubber: SNUB=1
TEXT 640 -32 Left 2 ;RCD CLAMP: D2 ES2D, C15 22n, R9||R10||R20 = 3 x 4.7k = 1.57k
TEXT 1056 -32 Left 2 ;SECONDARY: T1 secondary (Ns = Np/1.5), D3 || D7 SS510C, C20/C21 + C18/C19, load
TEXT 1104 336 Left 1 ;Secondary ground (SGND) shares the simulator ground: the transformer still isolates the windings
TEXT 16 560 Left 2 ;24 V -> 12 V / 1 A DCM flyback, OPEN LOOP (fixed duty D). EMC demo board power stage.
TEXT 16 592 Left 2 ;Knobs:  Rg = 4.7 / 22 / 100 ohm (RG)  ->  enable the .step line below to compare switching speed
TEXT 16 624 Left 2 ;        SNUB = 1  -> drain RC snubber C16/R11 fitted (SNUB)      Lpcb = hot-loop stray inductance
TEXT 16 656 Left 2 ;        D, Vin, Rload: duty cycle, input voltage, load (12.2 ohm = 1 A)
TEXT 16 688 Left 2 ;T1: Lp = 8 uH, Np:Ns = 1.5:1, k = 0.9747 -> leakage ~0.4 uH (Wurth 750311591 datasheet)
TEXT 16 720 Left 2 ;Plots: V(drain), I(Lp), V(gate), V(vout), I(Ls). Results of .meas: View > SPICE Error Log
TEXT 16 800 Left 2 !.param Vin=24 fs=154k D=0.245 Rload=12.2
TEXT 16 832 Left 2 !.param Rg=4.7 SNUB=0 Lpcb=10n
TEXT 16 864 Left 2 !.param Lp_val=8u n=1.5
TEXT 16 896 Left 2 !K1 Lp Ls 0.9747
TEXT 16 928 Left 2 !.tran 0 3m 2.8m 2n
TEXT 16 960 Left 2 !.ic V(vout)=12
TEXT 16 992 Left 2 !.model IRF520N VDMOS(Vto=3.6 Kp=6 lambda=0.03 Rd=0.11 Rs=0.025 Rg=2.5 Cgdmax=600p Cgdmin=25p a=0.5 Cgs=300p Cjo=260p M=0.55 Vj=0.8 Is=2e-12 Rb=0.02 N=1.1 Tt=60n mfg=Infineon Vds=100 Ron=200m Qg=25n)
